    "how": "Each Animate-panel tile was clicked on the selected paragraph and element.animation / element.Sz.ref were read back from Canva's React design model (see docs/canva-animation-parity.md). Minified keys (Xw, qg, Bf, Sz, R2a, BJa, N5a) rotate between Canva deploys — the importer must resolve them structurally.",
    "notes": [
      "A freshly clicked preset stores no config at all (no Xw) — durations come from Canva's page defaults.",
      "RTL text stores an explicit direction 4 (left) for Pan, Wipe, Drift and Block.",
      "'both' writes qg:{} and Bf:{} (empty = default timing); 'exit only' removes qg.",
      "Speed 'slow' (c=0.1) writes qg.durationUs=5000000 and Bf.durationUs=2000000.",
      "Reverse-exit toggle writes Bf.reverse:true.",
      "Repeating effects default to Vd 0; rotate/pulse carry direction 1.",
      "'مسح الرسوم المتحركة' (clear) writes animation {type:'none'} and drops the Sz repeating record — treat type 'none' as no animation."
    ]
